Suggests: bubblewrap
Description: Lightweight coding agent CLI and WebUI
 NanoPi is a lightweight agent harness tailored from Pi Coding Agent,
 featuring both a terminal UI and a browser WebUI. It provides an atomic
 tool execution loop (read, bash, edit, write, grep, find, ls) with
 built-in modules and zero npm runtime dependencies.
